{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55894","headline":"偈颂（幷序○序爲南岳齐己撰） 五十一 · 居遁","name":"偈颂（幷序○序爲南岳齐己撰） 五十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"成佛人稀念佛多，念来岁久却成魔。\n君今欲得易（《传灯录》作「自」）成佛，无念之心（《传灯录》作「人」）不较多。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"居遁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55894.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55894","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}